  "GREAT Scholarships 2026 – India and Thailand",
  "You are here",
  "In partnership with the British Council and the GREAT Britain Campaign, the Royal Northern College of Music is offering a scholarship to students in India and a scholarship to students in Thailand applying for postgraduate courses in Music.",
  "The GREAT Scholarships 2026 programme, launched by the British Council together with over 60 UK universities, supports postgraduate students from Bangladesh, China, Egypt, Ghana, India, Indonesia, Kenya, Malaysia, Mexico, Nigeria, Pakistan, Thailand, Turkey and Vietnam to access world-class UK higher education opportunities.",
  "The scholarship programme offers financial support of a minimum of £10,000 to students pursuing one-year postgraduate study in the UK. Students can apply for courses in a range of subjects, at over 60 institutions across England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland.",
